# ds5dongle-oled-edition
===
 DS5 Dongle OLED Edition: a Raspberry Pi Pico 2 W that connects a DualSense over Bluetooth while games see a wired one (adaptive triggers, HD haptics, speaker, mic). Optional OLED, desktop app, in-dongle calibration. Fork of awalol/DS5Dongle.
